-- Which of two cycles is drawn is chosen by field-name TEXT: `g`
-- holds `zeta`, a `List` cycle, and `alpha`, a `Maybe` cycle; `zeta` is
-- interned first (it is written in `A.beni` and before `alpha`), so a search
-- in symbol order meets the `List` cycle. The message draws `alpha`'s.
pub zeta : Int
zeta = 1
